<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in; background-color: transparent">For
value received <FONT STYLE="font-variant: small-caps"><B>CleanCore Solutions, Inc.</B>,</FONT> a Nevada corporation (the &ldquo;<U>Company</U>&rdquo;),
promises to pay to Larry Little or such party&rsquo;s assigns (the &ldquo;<U>Holder</U>&rdquo;) the principal amount set forth above (the
&ldquo;<U>Principal Amount</U>&rdquo;), with simple interest on the outstanding Principal Amount at the rate of fifteen percent (15%)
per annum (the &ldquo;<U>Interest Rate</U>&rdquo;). Interest shall commence the date hereof and shall continue to accrue on the outstanding
Principal Amount until paid in full. Interest shall be computed on the basis of a year of 365 days for the actual number of days elapsed.
All unpaid interest and principal shall be due and payable on October 10, 2025 (such date the &ldquo;<U>Maturity Date</U>&rdquo;).</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in; background-color: transparent"><FONT STYLE="font-variant: small-caps"><B>&nbsp;</B></FONT></P>

