<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in; background-color: transparent"><B>(f) Binding
Agreement</B>. The terms and conditions of this Note shall inure to the benefit of and be binding upon the respective successors and assigns
of the parties. Nothing in this Note, expressed or implied, is intended to confer upon any third party any rights, remedies, obligations
or liabilities under or by reason of this Note, except as expressly provided in this Note.</P>

